The specs in the table below allow a spread of +/- 10%. However the
accuracy of the service monitor, R2670, needs to be taken into account.
Since the accuracy of the service monitor is only +/- 5%, the allowable
spread in=20
the measured deviation should only be +/- 5% not +/- 10% as shown in the
