<h3><span id=3D"STATUS_PANEL/SOFTWARE_VERSION/SET_STATION_DATE_AND_TIME_MEN=
U_HELP"></span><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"STATUS_PANEL.2FSOFTWARE_VE=
